# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every working copy, whatever
# core.autocrlf says. The dotfiles are symlinked straight from this checkout,
# so a CRLF working copy on Windows would hand CRLF to every tool reading them
# -- and the same files are read on Linux and macOS. Windows PowerShell 5.1
# reads LF .ps1 files without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf
